-- The opening edge is written first: AFTER 3 WITHIN 30, never WITHIN 30
-- AFTER 3. One order is parsed; the other is a PARSE error naming the order
-- (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.2; "order carries meaning" was put and
-- rejected on 2026-09-16).

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 30 AFTER 3
